G5119.def:
**τότε**, _demonstr. adv._ of time, correlat. of ὅτε,
**then, at that time**;
(a) **of concurrent events**: [[Mat.2.17; 3.5|Mat.2:17 3:5]] and freq., [[Rom.6.21|Rom.6:21]] before ptcp., [[Mat.2.16|Mat.2:16]], [[Gal.4.8|Gal.4:8]]; opposite to νῦν, [[Gal.4.29|Gal.4:29]], [[Heb.12.26|Heb.12:26]]; ὁ τ. κόσμος, [[2Pe.3.6|2Pe.3:6]]
(b) of consequent events, **then, thereupon**: [[Mat.2.7; 3.5; 4.1|Mat.2:7 3:5 4:1]] and freq., [[Luk.11.26|Luk.11:26]] τ. οὖν, [[Jhn.11.14; 19.1, 16; 20.8|Jhn.11:14 19:1, 16 20:8]]; εὐθέως τ., [[Act.17.14|Act.17:14]] ὅτε . . . τ., [[Mat.13.26; 21.1|Mat.13:26 21:1]], [[Jhn.12.16|Jhn.12:16]]; ἀπὸ τ., [[Mat.4.17; 16.21; 26.16|Mat.4:17 16:21 26:16]], [[Luk.16.16|Luk.16:16]];
(with) **of things future**: [[Mat.24.28, 40; 25.1, 31|Mat.24:28, 40 25:1, 31]]ff.; opposite to ἄρτι, [[1Co.13.12|1Co.13:12]] καὶ τ., [[Mat.7.23|Mat.7:23]], [[Mrk.13.21|Mrk.13:21]], [[Luk.21.27|Luk.21:27]], [[1Co.4.5|1Co.4:5]], al.; ὅταν . . . τ., [[Mat.9.15|Mat.9:15]], [[Mrk.2.20|Mrk.2:20]], [[Luk.5.35|Luk.5:35]], [[1Th.5.3|1Th.5:3]], al. (more frequently in Mt than in the rest of the NT).
(AS)

G5192.def:
**ὑακίνθος**, -ου, ό
[in LXX chiefly for תְּכֵלֶת ;]
**hyacinth**;
(a) in cl., a flower, prob. the dark blue iris;
(b) **in late writers, a precious stone of the same colour, perhaps the sapphire**: [[Rev.21.20|Rev.21:20]] (Phil., FlJ, al.).†
(AS)
